=== A: whole design, 16 words
--- informal-kind, limit 20s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_sa                         assume  unprocessed
a_read                       assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_read                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
--- ric3-ic3, limit 60s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_sa                         assume  unprocessed
a_read                       assert  proven        ric3-ic3
c_read                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
--- the helper, proved alone and then assumed
--- informal-kind, limit 20s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_sa                         assume  unprocessed
a_read                       assert  disabled      ric3-ic3
c_read                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
h_mem                        assert  proven        informal-kind
--- informal-kind, limit 20s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_sa                         assume  unprocessed
a_read                       assert  proven        informal-kind
c_read                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
h_mem                        assert  disabled      informal-kind
m_mem                        assume  unprocessed
