=== C: 256 words, storage black-boxed, contract assumed
--- informal-kind, limit 30s for each property
informal: black boxes in this model (outputs free, contents not modelled): mem_store. A proof holds for the design; a counterexample may use output values the boxed logic cannot produce
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_sa                         assume  unprocessed
a_read                       assert  proven        informal-kind
c_read                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
m_store                      assume  unprocessed
